      "Obliczamy stosunek $|AD|$ do $|DB|$: $\\frac{|AD|}{|DB|} = \\frac{x \\sqrt{3}}{\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{3}}} = x \\sqrt{3} \\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{x} = 3$."
